'''FlipSid3 Tactics''' (alt. '''Flipside Tactics''' and abbreviated as '''F3''') was an [[:Category:United States|American]] esports organization. They have previously hosted three [[:Category:Sweden|Swedish]] squads and a [[:Category:CIS|CIS]] squad. They also housed a [[:Category:South Africa|South African]] squad under the name of [[FlipSid3 Tactics.za]] as well as an academy lineup from the [[:Category:United States|United States]], under the name of [[FlipSid3 Tactics Academy]].

