|content6=
* March 17th - [[B1ad3]]'s loan to [[Gambit Esports]] ends and he becomes a free agent. <ref name="B1ad3 leaves">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/GambitEsports/status/1107342905033797632|title=Gambit Esports releases bondik and B1ad3 of Gambit CS:GO.|date=2019-03-17|publisher=[[Gambit Esports]]}}</ref>

|content5=
* January 14th - [[seized]]'s loan ends with '''FlipSid3 Tactics''' and he returns to [[Natus Vincere]]. <ref name="seized free agent">{{cite web|url=https://www.instagram.com/p/Bd9G_7Xh5V1/|date=2018-01-14|title=Despite that awful result, i would like to say thanks to @flipsid3tactics for that small but funny journey.|author=[[seized]]}}</ref>
* April 20th - [[lollipop21k]] is signed from [[GoodJob]]. <ref name="lollipop21k joins">{{cite web|url=https://www.hltv.org/news/23361/lollipop21k-joins-flipsid3|date=2018-04-20|title=lollipop21k joins FlipSid3|publisher=''[[HLTV]]''|author=Zvonimir "[[Professeur]]" Burazin}}</ref>
* July 19th - [[WorldEdit]] and [[lollipop21k]] are transfer listed. [[B1ad3]] becomes coach. <ref name="f3 reconstructing">{{cite web|url=http://www.flipsidetactics.com/news/f3-csgo-restructuring/|date=2018-07-19|title=WorldEdit, lollipop21k trasfer listed; B1ad3 becomes coach of the team.|publisher='''FlipSid3 Tactics'''}}</ref>
* July 24th - [[B1ad3]] is loaned to [[Gambit Esports]] as their coach till September 30th. <ref name="B1ad3 to Gambit">{{cite web|url=https://gambit.gg/news/official-statements/b1ad3-joins-gambit-csgo-as-coach-on-a-loan-from-flipsid3-tactics|title=B1ad3 joins Gambit CS:GO as coach on a loan from FlipSid3 Tactics|date=2018-07-24|publisher=[[Gambit Esports]]}}</ref>
* July 30th - [[lollipop21k]] departs the team. <ref name="lollipop21k departs the team.">{{cite web|url=https://vk.com/wall-127555829_10246|date=2018-07-30|title=Free Agent. Открыт для предложений.|trans_title=FreeAgent. Open to suggestions.|publisher=[[lollipop21k]]}}</ref>
* October 7th - '''FlipSid3 Tactics''' and [[Gambit Esports]] reach an agreement to extend [[B1ad3]]'s loan until the end of October. <ref name="blad3 loan extended">{{cite web|url=https://www.hltv.org/news/25018/gambit-flipsid3-agree-b1ad3-loan-extension|date=2018-10-07|title=Gambit, FlipSid3 agree B1ad3 loan extension|author=[[MIRAA]]|publisher=[[HLTV]]}}</ref>
* October 19th - [[wayLander]] and [[WorldEdit]] part ways with '''FlipSid3 Tactics''' to join [[Winstrike Team]]. <ref name="waylander leaves">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/Winstrike_Team/status/1053249295216971776|title=We officially present you our updated Winstrike Team CS:GO roster|author=[[Winstrike Team]]|date=2018-10-19}}</ref>

|content4=
* November 6th - [[electronic]] leaves the team to join [[Natus Vincere]], '''FlipSid3 Tactics''' sign [[seized]] on loan to replace him. <ref name="electronic leaves, seized joins">{{cite web|url=http://www.flipsidetactics.com/news/flipsid3-tactics-electronic-part-ways/|date=2017-11-06|title=FlipSid3 Tactics and Electronic Part Ways|author=Dana Kawar|publisher='''FlipSid3 Tactics'''}}</ref>

|content3=
* April 20th - [[bondik]]'s contract with '''FlipSid3 Tactics''' expires and he leaves the team. <ref name="bondik set to leave FlipSid3">[https://www.hltv.org/news/17603-bondik-set-to-leave-flipsid3 bondik set to leave FlipSid3] ''[[HLTV]]''</ref>
* April 26th - '''FlipSid3 Tactics''' sign [[kane]] as their head coach. <ref name="kane became coach of FlipSid3">[https://play.esea.net/teams/104572?tab=roster] ''ESEA''</ref>
* June 20th - '''FlipSid3 Tactics''' acquire [[wayLander]] from [[Gambit Gaming]]. <ref name="wayLander joins">{{cite web|url=http://www.flipsidetactics.com/news/f3-signs-waylander/|date=2016-06-20|title=Gambit and FlipSid3 close deal on wayLander|author=[[MJ Finch]]|publisher=FlipSid3 Tactics}}</ref>
* September 21st - '''FlipSid3 Tactics''' sign [[electronic]] on trial; [[Shara]] steps off the active roster. <ref name="FlipSid3 trial electronic">{{cite web|url=https://www.hltv.org/news/18746-flipsid3-trial-electronic|date=2016-09-21|title=FlipSid3 trial electronic|author=Luis "[[MIRAA]]" Mira|publisher=[[HLTV]]}}</ref>

|content2=
* January 27th - '''FlipSid3 Tactics''' part ways with their lineup. <ref name="F3 lose CS:GO team">[https://www.hltv.org/n/14091 F3 lose CS:GO team] ''[[HLTV]]''</ref>
* February 1st - '''FlipSid3 Tactics''' sign [[dAT Team]]: [[B1ad3]], [[WorldEdit]], [[bondik]], [[s1mple]] and [[markeloff]] join. <ref name="FlipSid3 sign dAT Team">[https://www.hltv.org/news/14140-flipsid3-sign-dat-team] ''[[HLTV]]''</ref>
* July 17th - [[s1mple]] steps off the active roster, following internal problems culminating at [[ESWC 2015]]. <ref name="s1mple leaves">http://vk.com/wall-64241379_94437</ref>, but remains being contracted under the organization.
* October 23rd - '''FlipSid3 Tactics''' release [[s1mple]]. <ref>{{cite web|url=https://www.hltv.org/news/16212-flipsid3-release-s1mple|title=FlipSid3 release s1mple|date=2015-10-23|author=Luis "[[MIRAA]]" Mira|publisher=HLTV}}</ref>

|content1=
* March 28th - '''FlipSid3 Tactics''' acquire the [[highgrade]] roster: [[barsiC]], [[windster]], [[zape]], [[relIk]] and [[hydrox]] join. <ref name="Fliside land Highgrade">[https://www.hltv.org/news/12278-flipside-land-highgrade Fliside land Highgrade] ''[[HLTV]]''</ref>
* April 23rd - [[windster]] leaves.
* April 24th - [[Jumpy]] joins.
* July 14th - '''FlipSid3 Tactics''' announce a new Swedish squad: [[MODDII]], [[schneider]], [[pyth]], [[twist]] and [[cENTRYZ]] join. <ref name="MODDII returns in FlipSid3 Tactics">[https://www.hltv.org/news/12807-moddii-returns-in-flipsid3-tactics MODDII returns in FlipSid3 Tactics] ''[[HLTV]]''</ref>
* August 6th - [[Spitfire]] replaces [[pyth]]. <ref name="FlipSid3 Tactics bring in Spitfire">[https://www.hltv.org/news/12957-flipsid3-tactics-bring-in-spitfire FlipSid3 Tactics bring in Spitfire] ''[[HLTV]]</ref>
* August 19th - [[MODDII]] leaves. <ref name="MODDII leaves Flipsid3">[https://www.hltv.org/news/13088-moddii-leaves-flipsid3 MODDII leaves Flipsid3] ''[[HLTV]]''</ref>
* August 26th - [[Jumpy]] replaces [[twist]]. <ref name="Jumpy joins Flipsid3; twist leaves">[https://www.hltv.org/news/13121-jumpy-joins-flipsid3-twist-leaves Jumpy joins Flipsid3; twist leaves] ''[[HLTV]]</ref>
* September 16 - '''FlipSid3 Tactics''' disbands their Swedish squad. <ref name="Flipsid3 CS:GO Disbands">[http://www.flipsidetactics.com/news/flipsid3-csgo-disbands/ Flipsid3 CS:GO Disbands] ''flipsidetactics.com''</ref>
* September 24th - '''FlipSid3 Tactics''' announce new a Swedish squad: [[twist]], [[berg]], [[BENDJI]], [[robiin]] and [[Dumas]] join. <ref name="twist returns in FlipSid3 Tactics">[https://www.hltv.org/news/13275-twist-returns-in-flipsid3-tactics twist returns in FlipSid3 Tactics] ''[[HLTV]]''</ref>
* October 21st - [[robiin]] leaves due to his VAC Ban from May 2013. [[zende]] joins to fill the gap left by robiin. <ref name="DH qual without VAC-banned players">[https://www.hltv.org/news/13440-dh-qual-without-vac-banned-players DH qual without VAC-banned players] ''[[HLTV]]''</ref>
* December 23rd - '''FlipSid3 Tactics''' part ways with [[BENDJI]] and [[Dumas]]. <ref name="FlipSid3 part with BENDJI, Dumas">[https://www.hltv.org/news/13880-flipsid3-part-with-bendji-dumas FlipSid3 part with BENDJI, Dumas] ''[[HLTV]]''</ref>
* December 31st - '''FlipSid3 Tactics''' sign [[schneider]] and [[pauf]]. <ref name="Flipsid3 acquire schneider and pauf">[https://www.hltv.org/news/13905-schneider-pauf-join-flipsid3 Flipsid3 acquire schneider and pauf] ''[[HLTV]]''</ref>
}}

